    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: The ua-civ-escalation line (rifleman, baton man, launcher man) and riot (Instigator, three protesters at a stone source, plus a Hostile Gunman who draws a hidden rifle) but under a WARN ceiling (EL-2). Demonstrates that a Warn ceiling holds every round for 40 s. Judge: (1) the riot starts (2) no police round and no baton blow at all: every police mount keeps its ammo, no rioter is stunned, irritated, down or hurt (3) the Warning cue is shown (4) rounds are held as 'hold: warning'. Fail: any police weapon fires, or any rioter is hurt by police. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch ua-civ-escalation-warn"
  },
